WEBVTT

00:14:56.350 --> 00:15:00.687
at a place called Göbekli Tepe
in eastern Turkey.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.482
In North America,

00:15:03.523 --> 00:15:05.817
long before the coming of maize farming,

00:15:05.859 --> 00:15:10.489
indigenous populations created
the massive earthworks of poverty point

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:11.949
in Louisiana,

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.911
capable of hosting hunter gatherer
publics in their thousands.

00:15:15.953 --> 00:15:20.248
And then Japan, again,
long before the arrival of rice farming,

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:25.587
the storehouses of Sannai Maruyama
could already hold great surpluses

00:15:25.629 --> 00:15:27.464
of wild plant foods.

00:15:27.464 --> 00:15:30.217
Now what do all these details amount to?